{"id":"en_my-witnesses-aren-t-human","title":"My Witnesses Aren't Human","titleEn":"My Witnesses Aren't Human","description":"Lila Carter works as a clerk until she gains the unexpected ability to comprehend animals. Using hamsters, roaches, flies, and rats as her informants, she assists the police in cracking murder cases. What begins as a pursuit of reward money gradually turns into a perilous vocation, especially when she sets her sights on a serial killer who has evaded capture for seven years. Through this journey, she transforms into a bold investigator who relies on the animal kingdom to uncover the truth.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-witnesses-arent-human/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-witnesses-arent-human/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Mystery","Contemporary","Urban","Inspirational","Female","Supernatural"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diwe6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-witnesses-aren-t-human_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diwe6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-witnesses-aren-t-human_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diwe6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-witnesses-aren-t-human_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diwe6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-witnesses-aren-t-human_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diwe6/?pub=4occak","ki